.claude
package-lock.json

# Third-party, vendored verbatim — ONNX Runtime Web and the openWakeWord
# models. Formatting a 49 KB minified bundle would be destructive and
# pointless, and these keep their own licenses (see vendor/wake/NOTICE.md).
# Previously only the explicit globs in the "format" script kept Prettier out
# of here, so a bare `npx prettier --write .` would have rewritten them.
vendor

# Markdown is written by hand and not formatted. Prettier re-indents
# continuation lines under list items, which reflows the prose rather than
# normalising it — README.md alone would change 226 of its 1,125 lines.
*.md

# Captured API responses, kept byte-for-byte as the upstream service returned
# them. Prettifying a fixture makes it no longer a faithful capture.
agents/test/fixtures

# Doc artifacts rather than project source: alarm-clock.gs is pasted into the
# Google Apps Script editor as-is.
docs
